    {
      "id": "frag-5",
      "focal_uid": 5,
      "title": "Keeping people alive for decades",
      "insight": "A ship that recycles 99% of its air, water and food is a fundamentally different vehicle from one that recycles 70% - the second needs resupply nobody can send. Orbital industry and shipboard autonomy feed the loop, and the loop pushes on both stasis technology and the date itself.",
