    {
      "id": "frag-12",
      "focal_uid": 12,
      "title": "A reason to go",
      "insight": "Almost nothing causes the discovery of a habitable world at Alpha Centauri - in the models it is a root cause, a fact about the universe we either find or we don't. Confirm an Earth-analog and robotic precursors follow, and the whole programme gains a target worth a century of effort.",
